WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:04.299
The Beldam, commonly known as The Other Mother
was an evil entity that existed as early as

00:00:04.299 --> 00:00:05.299
the 1700s.

00:00:05.299 --> 00:00:09.440
It is not known when The Other Father came
into existence, but one line in the book suggests

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:13.089
that it was long before The Beldam created
the illusion of The Other World.

00:00:13.089 --> 00:00:15.740
He tells Coraline: “There isn’t anywhere
but here.

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:19.720
This is all she made: the house, the grounds,
and the people in the house.

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:21.220
She made it and she waited.”

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:25.760
This suggests that The Other Father was around
to see the creation of the house, the rats,

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:29.870
the dogbat things, and the other Miss Spink
and Forcible, and in the movie, the Other

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:31.460
Wybie, who is not in the book.

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:35.579
But unlike any of those creatures, The Other
Father demonstrates a will of its own to fight

00:00:35.579 --> 00:00:37.719
back against the influence of the Beldam.

00:00:37.719 --> 00:00:42.120
To explore the true nature of the mysterious
being behind the facade of The Other Father,

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:44.865
stick around to the end of this video.

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:53.190
The Other World is the creepy, harrowing alternate
realm adjacent to Coraline’s home.

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:57.149
It was created by The Beldam, looking to feast
on the souls of whatever children it can lure

00:00:57.149 --> 00:00:58.590
into its domain.

00:00:58.590 --> 00:01:02.329
Everything it created was a twisted copy of
something from Coraline’s world, except

00:01:02.329 --> 00:01:06.960
for The Other Father, who seems to have existed
long before Coraline’s real father was in

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:07.558
the picture.

00:01:07.558 --> 00:01:08.960
Welcome to Horror History.

